# Project records

On every change in this repo (code, config, or a decision), update the records below in the same change. Skip `node_modules/`, `lib/`, `out/`, `cache/`, and generated files.

## Changelog

Append to `.changelog/CHANGELOG.md`, newest entry first. One markdown file. Each entry has a date, what was done, the decision, and how it was implemented.

```markdown
## 2026-10-17 — Short title

- Done: what changed.
- Decision: why this approach.
- Implementation: files or approach used.
```

## Logic docs

Keep repo-root `docs/` markdown that explains what the code does and why. Update the page for the area you touched. Link pages from `docs/README.md`.

## Test docs

Coverage notes live in `test/docs/`. For each function or class under test: what is tested, how, and known holes (untested paths, skipped cases). Skip tests under `lib/`.
